{# ============================================================================
   THE RAIL BESIDE THE REPORT FORM.

   The form is 860px wide and the screen is not, so on a wide viewport there was a
   column of nothing beside a form somebody was filling in. What belongs there is
   the two things the form cannot say for itself:

     THE OBSERVATION — only where the filing came from a record. The strip at the
     top of the page proves it exists; this says what it said and who recorded it.

     WHAT THIS KIND ASKS — always. Every block the chosen sub-category switched on,
     with the gate's own marks against them.

   A WALK-IN FILING IS THE SECOND CARD ALONE, and that is the commonest filing
   there is: somebody walked into an office, there is no record behind it, and the
   rail is still the place that says what is left to answer.

   THE RAIL STANDS STILL AND THE FORM SCROLLS PAST IT. What is in the rail is read
   AGAINST the questions, and a reader who has to scroll away from a question to
   see what it asks for has lost the thing the rail is for. So the rail is fixed
   under the shell's top bar and scrolls inside itself. Below 1160px the two
   columns cannot both stand: the rail stacks under the form and is a plain block
   again, and the form keeps its width — the rail is extra help, never a reason for
   the form to get narrower (see incidents.css).

   Parameters: controller, kinds, chosen, prefill, answers, blocksMissing, checklists
   ========================================================================== #}
<aside class="i-rail">
    {% if prefill.hasProvenance %}
        {{ include('@UhifadhiIncident/report/_observation.html.twig', {prefill: prefill}, with_context: false) }}
    {% endif %}

    {{ include('@UhifadhiIncident/report/_checklist.html.twig', {
        controller: controller,
        kinds: kinds,
        chosen: chosen,
        prefill: prefill,
        answers: answers,
        blocksMissing: blocksMissing,
        checklists: checklists,
    }, with_context: false) }}
</aside>
